<title>JAPAN: Nihon Dempa Kogyo corrects group operating profit.</title>
<headline>Nihon Dempa Kogyo corrects group operating profit.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Nihon Dempa Kogyo Co Ltd on Thursday corrected its actual group operating profit result for the year to March 31, 1997, to 2.6 billion yen, instead of the 3.04 billion yen announced on June 6.</p>
<p>The company is a leading manufacturer of quartz electronic parts.</p>
